# nghttp2-apps named split: the nghttp/nghttpd/nghttpx/h2load client,
# server, proxy and load-testing tools plus their man pages. The
# protocol library stays in the base package for HTTP/2 clients
# (curl). The apps need c-ares (async DNS) and libev (event loop);
# the library needs neither (pure protocol codec), so base images
# stop dragging them in. inflatehd/deflatehd are deliberately
# disabled at configure time (HPACK debug tools, would need jansson).
# Every path below must exist after install (the splitter fails
# closed on missing paths).
usr/bin/nghttp
usr/bin/nghttpd
usr/bin/nghttpx
usr/bin/h2load
usr/share/man/man1/nghttp.1
usr/share/man/man1/nghttpd.1
usr/share/man/man1/nghttpx.1
usr/share/man/man1/h2load.1
